  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x10D0" flags="0x0">
    <title>Ignition_Advance_Threshold_for_Cylinder_Fuel_Enrichment</title>
    <description>bms46_table_3d_u8 at 0x00A28E; semantic status FUNCTION_CONFIRMED; formula status PARTIAL. Stable ID=CAL_TABLE_00A28E. Consumers=calculate_Engine_Knock. Selection=The lookup writes 0xFF83B7. FUN_0002034e compares that threshold against each cylinder timing value, converts only a positive deficit to a 0x80-centered factor, and FUN_0001c346 multiplies each cylinder's injection time by that factor with a Q7 shift.. Only formulas explicitly stated as confirmed are engineering units.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="1" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
